primary"><svg height=1em width=1em class="-my-[2px] size-[16px]" data-icon=globe><symbol id=ai:local:globe viewBox="0 0 24 24"><g fill=none stroke=currentColor stroke-linecap=round stroke-linejoin=round stroke-width=2><circle cx=12 cy=12 r=10 /><path d="M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20M2 12h20"/></g></symbol><use href=#ai:local:globe></use></svg> <span class=mt-px>What We Do</span></div><h2 class="font-normal whitespace-pre-line mb-3 md:text-5xl text-3xl">Web scraping without the infrastructure</h2><div class="flex justify-between empty:hidden items-baseline max-md:flex-col max-md:items-center"><p class="text-sm md:text-base lg:max-w-[700px] max-md:text-center text-balance whitespace-pre-line">HasData provides a managed scraping pipeline for product teams. Send any URL, get clean JSON or Markdown back. We handle everything in between.</p></div></div><div class=container><div class="relative grid grid-cols-1 !mt-6 border-t hd-divide-x py-2 xl:grid-cols-3"><div class="py-5 px-6 xl:border-l xl:first-of-type:border-l-transparent xl:first-of-type:pl-3"><div class="border rounded-md bg-primary/5 border-primary/25 mb-4 p-1.5 text-primary w-fit"><svg height=1em width=1em class=size-5 data-icon=app-window><symbol id=ai:local:app-window viewBox="0 0 24 24"><g fill=none stroke=currentColor stroke-linecap=round stroke-linejoin=round stroke-width=2><rect height=16 width=20 rx=2 x=2 y=4 /><path d="M10 4v4M2 8h20M6 4v4"/></g></symbol><use href=#ai:local:app-window></use></svg></div><h3 class="font-normal text-xl">Headless browser rendering</h3><p class="text-sm mt-3">We run thousands of headless browser instances. Dynamic content, SPAs, and client-side JavaScript rendered automatically. 1.9s median response time.</p></div><div class="py-5 px-6 xl:border-l xl:first-of-type:border-l-transparent xl:first-of-type:pl-3"><div class="border rounded-md bg-primary/5 border-primary/25 mb-4 p-1.5 text-primary w-fit"><svg height=1em width=1em class=size-5 data-icon=refresh-cw><symbol id=ai:local:refresh-cw viewBox="0 0 24 24"><g fill=none stroke=currentColor stroke-linecap=round stroke-linejoin=round stroke-width=2><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 0 1 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1 6.74 2.74L21 8"/><path d="M21 3v5h-5m5 4a9 9 0 0 1-9 9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1-6.74-2.74L3 16"/><path d="M8 16H3v5"/></g></symbol><use href=#ai:local:refresh-cw></use></svg></div><h3 class="font-normal text-xl">Automatic proxy rotation</h3><p class="text-sm mt-3">Requests route through a managed pool combining 10+ proxy providers and a private residential network. Geo-targeting and IP rotation included in every call.</p></div><div class="py-5 px-6 xl:border-l xl:first-of-type:border-l-transparent xl:first-of-type:pl-3"><div class="border rounded-md bg-primary/5 border-primary/25 mb-4 p-1.5 text-primary w-fit"><svg height=1em width=1em class=size-5 data-icon=sparkles><symbol id=ai:local:sparkles viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0zM20 3v4m2-2h-4M4 17v2m1-1H3" stroke=currentColor stroke-linecap=round stroke-linejoin=round stroke-width=2 fill=none /></symbol><use href=#ai:local:sparkles></use></svg></div><h3 class="font-normal text-xl">APIs, no-code scrapers and AI extraction</h3><p class="text-sm mt-3">63 API endpoints and 21 available no-code scrapers. AI extraction turns a page into structured JSON using the fields you describe.</p></div><div class="absolute hd-divide-x bottom-0 -left-[150px] -right-[70px] border-b"></div><div class="absolute border-r hd-divide-y -left-3 md:-left-6 sm:-left-5 -bottom-[14vh] -top-[30vh]"></div><div class="absolute border-r hd-divide-y -right-3 md:-right-6 sm:-right-5 -bottom-[8vh] -top-[4vh]"></div></div></div></section><section class=section><div class="flex flex-col max-md:items-center container max-md:text-center"><d